        <Content>
          <span size="36.0" bold="true">CO2 electro-reduction in PEM cell
</span>
          <span size="36.0">Simulation of a PEM cell processing a carbon dioxide feed in the cathode and a water feed in the anode to produce oxygen at the cathode and carbon monoxide and hydrogen at the anode</span>
        </Content>
        <Border style="NO_BORDER" width="1">
          <lineColour Red="0" Green="0" Blue="0"/>
          <shadowColour Red="0" Green="0" Blue="0"/>
        </Border>
