      <TextBlock layer="Layer 1" zorder="-77">
        <Transform ScaleX="2627.0" ScaleY="248.00000000000003" ShearX="0.0" ShearY="0.0" TranslateX="3722.2765546655332" TranslateY="10.08620381136367"/>
        <Content>
          <span size="36.0" bold="true">Steady-state alkaline water electrolyser system simulation
</span>
          <span size="36.0">Alkaline electrolyser system with KOH solution circulation pump, cooler, gas-liquid separators, deoxy unit and simple dryer. 
</span>
          <span size="36.0">
</span>
          <span size="36.0">The electrolyser stack operates with an electric power input of 5MW and calculates the performance of the electrolyser system including: prediction of the stack voltage and current, heat dissipated (via the cooler), gas compositions exiting the anode and cathode separators, water consumption rate and gas production rates.</span>
        </Content>
        <Border style="NO_BORDER" width="1">
          <lineColour Red="0" Green="0" Blue="0"/>
          <shadowColour Red="0" Green="0" Blue="0"/>
        </Border>
      </TextBlock>
